  "instructions": [
    "In a blender or food processor, blend kippers, soy sauce, fish sauce, brown sugar, garlic, ginger, and chili flakes until coarsely chopped.",
    "Heat coconut oil in a non-stick skillet over medium heat.",
    "Add the kipper mixture to the skillet and cook, breaking it up with a spoon, until it's lightly browned and crispy.",
    "Stir in lemon juice and cook for an additional 2 minutes.",
    "Thread the kipper mixture onto skewers.",
    "Brush the cucumber slices with a little water and grill them over medium heat until slightly charred.",
    "Serve the kipper satay hot with grilled cucumber slices and garnish with mint leaves.",
    "Garnish with additional mint leaves and serve immediately."
